# nested-tags — шаги записи (что показывается — nested-tags.md)
# Заказ 2026-10-07 после ревизии документации: Child tag format → Nested — родитель и ребёнок одним тегом,
# в строке и в свойстве заметки. Его 💬 2026-10-07: Inline to note — щелчком по плавающей кнопке →. Ребёнок #review под #done заводится на камеру, как в child-fields.
preset visual.tagWheel.fillColor = "#fff3bf"
preset transform.inline2note.enabled = true
preset transform.inline2note.floatingButton = true
preset transform.inline2note.openTarget = true
preset pkm.fields.order.propertiesByField = {"Status":"tags"}
title A child tag in one piece | Child tag format: two tags, or one nested tag
drop Priority
drop Due
drop Project
preset visual.tagWheel.scroller.enabled = true
open Nested tags.md
line-width 480
caret - #done || call the bank
stage A child Value
say #review under #done, Child Field → After parent
settings Tags & PKM
spot Values
fill #tag / tag = review
click Add Value
click Make #review a child Value
set Child Field = After parent
stage Separate
caret - #done || call the bank
say Default Separate: parent and child are two tags
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowRight
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - water the plants / - #done #review || call the bank
stage Nested
say Child tag format → Nested
settings Tags & PKM
set Child tag format = Nested (#doing/review)
caret - #done || call the bank
say Nested: one tag #done/review
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowRight
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - water the plants / - #done/review || call the bank
stage Into a note
say Click → : Inline to note, the property gets one tag
click →
say The new note: tags → done/review, one tag
pause 2500
expect tags: "#done/review" / - #done/review || call the bank
